{"3939910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Frustration", "steam_appid": 3939910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4811950], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIND A SERIAL KILLER BEFORE YOUR MIND COLLAPSES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Jeff Dowliff — a detective whose memory is slowly deteriorating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate murders using:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- newspapers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- polaroids</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- evidence boards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- handwritten notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But reality itself becomes unreliable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doors lead back to your apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Televisions speak directly to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blink can completely change the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you still solve the case when your own mind sabotages the investigation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > INVESTIGATE IMPOSSIBLE CRIMES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search crime scenes, analyze clues, connect evidence, and uncover hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REALITY CANNOT BE TRUSTED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hallucinations distort environments, memories change details, and familiar places become impossible spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILD YOUR OWN INVESTIGATION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use evidence boards, handwritten notes, polaroids, and newspapers to track suspects and connect the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A WORLD THAT GASLIGHTS YOU</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\